      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲉⲑⲃⲉⲫⲁⲓ ⲁϥⲉⲣⲁⲅⲱⲛⲓⲍⲉⲥⲑⲉ ϣⲁⲧⲉϥⲛⲁⲩ **ⲉ**ⲡⲉⲧⲣⲟⲥ .",
      "english": "For this reason he strove until he saw Peter.",
      "source": "Bohairic Lausiac History - Part 1",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:lausiac.boh_lausiac.amelineau_ed:0",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
